UNPROVISIONED DEVICE

This image deliberately contains no device identity, shared secret or cloud key.
Factory provisioning replaces the entire credentials partition per device.
Suggested layout (the cloud application defines the final schema):
  device.json           serial number, device ID and cloud endpoint
  cloud/client.crt.pem  per-device client certificate
  cloud/client.key.pem  per-device private key
  cloud/ca.crt.pem      cloud CA certificate

The runtime mounts this partition at /credentials read-only. Cloud applications
must refuse authentication if their required identity files are missing.
